-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.gateway-configuration-that-matters.q3":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.gateway-configuration-that-matters.q4":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.identity-at-the-edge.q1":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.identity-at-the-edge.q2":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.identity-at-the-edge.q3":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.identity-at-the-edge.q4":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.authorization-without-a-bottleneck.q1":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.authorization-without-a-bottleneck.q2":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.introducing-a-gateway-into-a-running-system.q1":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.introducing-a-gateway-into-a-running-system.q2":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.introducing-a-gateway-into-a-running-system.q3":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.internal-calls-sync-async-or-neither.q1":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.internal-calls-sync-async-or-neither.q2":"api-gateway-identity-edge","27-api-gateway-identity-edge.internal-calls-sync-async-or-neither.q3":"api-gateway-identity-edge"},"crossRefs":{"25-microservice.10-system-design-putting-it-all-together.q5":{"en":"A trade-off framework — there is no universally correct architecture","vi":"Khung trade-off — không có kiến trúc đúng"},"25-microservice.03-distributed-data-consistency.q3":{"en":"Sagas: orchestration vs choreography and compensation traps","vi":"Saga: orchestration vs choreography + cạm bẫy compensation"},"16-project-concurrency-whiteboard.presenting-dissecting-the-ota-project.q5":{"en":"Design the long-running OTA booking saga from hold through payment and ticket issue. Specify durable states and timers, transaction boundaries, idempotency, retries, unknown 